  "documented_deviations_in_force": [
    {
      "date": "2026-09-22",
      "id": "FCAST-V4-DEV-01",
      "kind": "implementation-correction",
      "registry": "DEC-F18",
      "status": "applied",
      "summary": "Missing (None, NaN, pd.NA, blank) is missing: a column whose present values are all numbers is numeric, and its missing values reach the pipeline's existing median imputer. No feature column was added and no feature group changed; the no-history case stays represented by the declared k = 0 budget of the scarcity ladder. The protocol already declares the history group numeric, so this makes the code do what the protocol says. Applied in the shared path, so v3 and v4 both."
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-09-22",
      "id": "FCAST-V4-DEV-02",
      "kind": "documented-deviation",
      "registry": "DEC-F18",
      "status": "applied",
      "summary": "contention_materialization_gate.minimum_paired_cells_per_target = 2. A target below it is `not-assessed: insufficient paired support`, neither passed nor failed, and its contention-materialisation claim is withdrawn rather than decided. A failing assessed target still aborts, and with no assessable target the gate is `not-assessed` and aborts. Per-target support (heavy cells, paired cells, minimum) is reported in the gate artifact."
    },
    {
      "date": "2026-09-22",
      "id": "FCAST-V4-DEV-03",
      "kind": "implementation-correction",
      "registry": "DEC-F18",
      "status": "applied",
      "summary": "Read-code defects that change no declared quantity: dataset_gate reads v4's per-origin repetitions and counts completion over measured executions; the platform fingerprint treats an empty value as unknown and a gated field missing on a completed row as a violation; analyse_rows reads the retired DEC-F20 platform_epoch block only where declared; fit_predict gives the prediction frame the fitted numeric type. The S feature group excludes the six thermal columns, which implements the contract's own thermal_reading_rule (no cross-target temperature comparison) rather than amending it."
    }
  ],
